<SECTION image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="cutting-edge fusion reactor technology with glowing plasma chamber" />
  <DIV class="body">
    <H1>Breakthrough Technologies to Watch</H1>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="outlineBoxes" cellSize="15">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Commonwealth Fusion Systems</H4>
        <P>SPARC reactor achieves net energy gain by 2025. Commercial fusion plants projected for 2030s could generate 400MW each, powering 300,000 homes with zero emissions.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Twelve's CO2-to-Chemicals</H4>
        <P>Converts captured carbon into jet fuel and plastics. Partnership with Alaska Airlines for sustainable aviation fuel. Technology could address 1.8 gigatons of annual CO2 emissions.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Form Energy's Iron-Air Batteries</H4>
        <P>100-hour energy storage at $20/kWh, one-tenth lithium cost. First commercial deployment in Minnesota stores renewable energy for entire communities during weather events.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Heirloom's Enhanced Rock Weathering</H4>
        <P>Accelerates natural carbon absorption 1,000x using limestone. Pilot projects remove 1,000 tons CO2 annually, with pathway to gigaton-scale deployment by 2035.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>